{"id": "unknown-2026-09-10-006", "date": "2026-09-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration", "automotive_display", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["growth"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "UBI Research sees fast growth ahead for mid-large OLEDs, led by monitors and automotive displays", "content": "<p>UBI Research estimates that medium and large OLED revenues will grow from $10 billion in 2026 to $15.15 billion in 2030, a CAGR of 11%.</p><img data-entity-uuid=\"b0c0f56d-0a3c-453d-847b-8ac14aa7cca9\" data-entity-type=\"file\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/inline-images/UBI-medium-large-OLED-revenue-2026-2030.png\" height=\"286\" width=\"439\" alt=\"Medium and large OLED revenues (2026-2030, UBI Research\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Most of the growth will come from two applications: monito", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/ubi-research-sees-fast-growth-ahead-mid-large-oleds-led-monitors-and-automotive", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "jdi-2026-09-10-007", "date": "2026-09-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["jdi"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Reports suggest OLEDWorks may be interested in JDI's 4.5-Gen Ishikawa fab", "content": "<p>An interesting report from Japan suggests that JDI is moving forward with selling two of its fabs in Japan. The first is the Mobara fab, that used to produce OLED wearable displays to Apple. The <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/japan-display-may-sell-its-mobara-display-fab-chinas-hkc\">equipment has already been sold to HKC</a>, and now it is reported that Micron is looking into acquiring the facility itself.</p><div class=\"align-center\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/reports-suggest-oledworks-may-be-interested-jdis-45-gen-ishikawa-fab", "type": "rss"}]}
