{"id": "unknown-2026-09-10-009", "date": "2026-09-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "The OLED Marketplace gets a major upgrade: search, a responsive redesign and faster browsing", "content": "<p>We are happy to announce that we have overhauled the <a href=\"https://marketplace.oled-info.com\">OLED Marketplace</a>, OLED-Info's free catalog of commercial OLED displays and lighting panels, with over 175 displays from nearly 30 manufacturers, covering AMOLED and PMOLED, flexible and transparent OLEDs, microdisplays, e-paper and OLED lighting.</p><a href=\"https://marketplace.oled-info.com\"><img src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/inline-images/The-OLED-Marketplace-2026.png\" d", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/oled-marketplace-gets-major-upgrade-search-responsive-redesign-and-faster", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-10-010", "date": "2026-09-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Cincon High-Performance Power Modules for Edge AI & IPCs", "content": "\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>As AI moves to the edge, IPCs demand compact, rugged power. Cincon offers baseplate-cooled DC-DC &#038; AC-DC solutions for fanless, harsh AIoT environments.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.eetimes.com/cincon-high-performance-power-modules-for-edge-ai-ipcs/\">Cincon High-Performance Power Modules for Edge AI &amp; IPCs </a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.eetimes.com\">EE Times</a>.</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t", "sources": [{"name": "eetimes", "url": "https://www.eetimes.com/cincon-high-performance-power-modules-for-edge-ai-ipcs/", "type": "rss"}]}
